  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\n`HTMLHyperlinkElementUtils`, [^1], is only included by `<a>` and `<area>` elements. Both latter elements may run script via `javascript:` URLs.\r\n\r\nCC @koto, @fred-wang \r\n\r\n[^1]: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlhyperlinkelementutils",
